## 7. Vector Drawing

### 7.1 Line

```csharp
page.DrawLine(80, 680, 500, 680, lineWidth: 1.2, strokeColor: new PdfColor(0.1, 0.2, 0.5));

page.DrawLine(
    80,
    660,
    500,
    660,
    strokeColor: PdfColor.Gray,
    strokeStyle: new PdfStrokeStyle
    {
        LineWidth = 2,
        LineCap = PdfLineCapStyle.Round,
        LineJoin = PdfLineJoinStyle.Bevel,
        DashArray = new[] { 6d, 3d },
        DashPhase = 0
    });
```

### 7.2 Rectangle

```csharp
page.DrawRectangle(
    x: 80,
    y: 620,
    width: 420,
    height: 80,
    lineWidth: 1,
    fill: true,
    strokeColor: PdfColor.Gray,
    fillColor: new PdfCmykColor(0.2, 0, 0, 0),
    strokeStyle: new PdfStrokeStyle
    {
        LineWidth = 1.5,
        DashArray = new[] { 4d, 2d }
    });
```

`PdfStrokeStyle` options:
- `LineWidth`
- `LineCap` (`Butt`, `Round`, `ProjectingSquare`)
- `LineJoin` (`Miter`, `Round`, `Bevel`)
- `DashArray` + `DashPhase`

### 7.3 Rounded Rectangle

```csharp
page.DrawRoundedRectangle(
    x: 80,
    y: 500,
    width: 240,
    height: 70,
    cornerRadius: 12,
    fill: true,
    strokeColor: new PdfColor(0.1, 0.2, 0.5),
    fillColor: new PdfGrayColor(0.92));
```

### 7.4 Circle

```csharp
page.DrawCircle(
    centerX: 400,
    centerY: 535,
    radius: 35,
    fill: true,
    strokeColor: PdfColor.Gray,
    fillColor: new PdfCmykColor(0.2, 0, 0, 0));
```

### 7.5 Polygon

```csharp
page.DrawPolygon(
    new[]
    {
        new PdfPoint(360, 470),
        new PdfPoint(430, 510),
        new PdfPoint(500, 470),
        new PdfPoint(480, 420),
        new PdfPoint(380, 420)
    },
    fill: true,
    strokeColor: new PdfColor(0.1, 0.2, 0.5),
    fillColor: new PdfGrayColor(0.9),
    strokeStyle: new PdfStrokeStyle { LineWidth = 1.2, DashArray = new[] { 5d, 2d } });
```

### 7.6 Bézier Curve

```csharp
page.DrawBezierCurve(
    start: new PdfPoint(90, 430),
    control1: new PdfPoint(180, 520),
    control2: new PdfPoint(280, 340),
    end: new PdfPoint(380, 430),
    strokeColor: new PdfColor(0.1, 0.2, 0.5),
    strokeStyle: new PdfStrokeStyle { LineWidth = 1.5, DashArray = new[] { 7d, 3d } });
```

