## 13. Page Numbers

Add page numbers across all pages using a document helper:

```csharp
document.AddPageNumbers(new PdfPageNumberOptions
{
    Alignment = PdfTextAlignment.Center,
    Y = 18,
    FontFamily = PdfFontFamily.Helvetica,
    FontSize = 10,
    FillColor = new PdfGrayColor(0.35)
});
```

`PdfPageNumberOptions` supports:
- start number and total-page format (`StartNumber`, `ShowTotalPages`, `Prefix`, `Separator`, `Suffix`)
- placement (`Y`, `MarginX`, `Alignment`)
- font and color (`Font` or `FontFamily` + style flags, `FontSize`, `FillColor`)

---

## 14. Headers and Footers

Add repeated header/footer text across all pages:

```csharp
document.AddHeadersAndFooters(new PdfHeaderFooterOptions
{
    HeaderTemplate = "Canvas.Pdf Demo",
    FooterTemplate = "{page}/{total}",
    HeaderAlignment = PdfTextAlignment.Left,
    FooterAlignment = PdfTextAlignment.Right,
    HeaderTopMargin = 20,
    FooterY = 20,
    MarginX = 40,
    FontFamily = PdfFontFamily.Helvetica,
    FontSize = 10,
    FillColor = new PdfGrayColor(0.4)
});
```

Template tokens:
- `{page}` current page number
- `{total}` last page number

